# known_clans.txt — clans to ALWAYS seed as discovery roots.
# The Clash API has no "list all Legend players" endpoint, so Legend clans that
# never rank in any location's top-200 are invisible to ranking-based discovery.
# Register them here so the seeder always inserts them and the update pass finds
# their Legend members.
#
# Format: one clan tag per line, WITHOUT the leading '#'. Lines starting with
# '#' are comments. Use tools/add_clans.py to add + insert one immediately.
#
# Example (one tag per line, no '#'):
# AB12CD34
